config BR2_PACKAGE_CHICAGO95
	bool "chicago95"
	help
	  The Chicago95 XFCE/GTK theme: a faithful Windows 95 look for
	  xfwm4, GTK 2/3, the panel and the icon set. This package also
	  installs the xfconf channel defaults that make it the active
	  theme out of the box.

	  https://github.com/grassmunk/Chicago95
